<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>MCP | Ireland Public Context Graph</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui;margin:40px;max-width:900px;line-height:1.5}code,pre{background:#f2f5f3;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;display:block;overflow:auto}</style></head><body><h1>Hosted MCP endpoint</h1><p>This project exposes read-only public data and relationships via a hosted MCP endpoint after Cloudflare deployment.</p><pre>{`{
  "mcpServers": {
    "ireland-public-context-graph": {
      "url": "https://ireland-public-context-graph-mcp.<cloudflare-subdomain>.workers.dev/mcp"
    }
  }
}`}</pre><p>The server retrieves data only. It does not generate conclusions, causation, fault claims or recommendations.</p><h2>Useful tools</h2><ul><li><code>get_source_registry</code> — source/data catalogue including global signal sources.</li><li><code>get_causal_tooling</code> — ingestion, geospatial, graph and causal-inference toolchain.</li><li><code>get_housing_planning_layers</code> — public planning/housing map layers with counts, schemas, extents, source links and sample GeoJSON.</li><li><code>get_housing_planning_context</code> — connected-dot graph linking housing/planning layers to factors, datasets, missing evidence and question paths.</li><li><code>activate_context_brain</code> — whole-knowledge-base activation across domains, sources, issues, factors, map layers, evidence and gaps.</li><li><code>get_context_brain</code> — raw whole-context brain artifact.</li><li><code>ask_public_context</code> — question → candidate factors, evidence and missingness.</li><li><code>get_real_world_graph</code> — places/assets/events/factors/datasets graph.</li></ul><p></p><p><a href="/">Back</a></p></body></html>
